ecific nanometer (nm) range used.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8dl6i247","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"e0fj7251","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"What Does \"nm\" Mean in Red Light Therapy?","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":24}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1pc17274","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The term \"nm\" stands for **nanometer**, which measures the wavelength of light. Different wavelengths penetrate the body at different depths and interact with tissues in unique ways. The most commonly used ranges in red light therapy are between **630–850 nm**, each offering distinct biological effects.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wudeg363","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"eoj5i371","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Understanding the Key Wavelengths","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":24}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"70tz6386","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"e0wtl426","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"630–670 nm (Visible Red Light)","decorations":[{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"z35vo439","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vx1gg388","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Best For:** Skin rejuvenation, wound healing, collagen production","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9d342390","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Penetration Depth:** About 1–3 mm (skin-deep)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"r4trr392","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Mechanism:** Stimulates fibroblasts and keratinocytes to increase collagen and elastin production.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"in904396","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Science:** A 2014 study in *Photomedicine and Laser Surgery* showed improved skintone and texture using 630 nm light for 8 weeks.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lpp0c517","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lwcbs539","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"810–850 nm (Near-Infrared Light)","decorations":[{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fmjh7717","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wal0f541","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Best For:** Muscle recovery, joint pain, inflammation, neurological repair","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9onxw543","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Penetration Depth:** Up to 50 mm (deep tissue, bone, brain)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ffrv5545","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Mechanism:** Increases ATP production, blood flow, and activates anti-inflammatory","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dgy93547","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"pathways at the mitochondrial level.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3cwcd549","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **Science:** Research from *Lasers in Surgery and Medicine* (2009) showed that","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"thgbb551","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"810–850 nm light improves recovery in patients with chronic joint pain and nerve damage.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4klka777","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"76h3u813","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Why Customizing Your NM Range Matters","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":24}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qyezp851","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ojcmp889","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Some red light therapy devices only emit a fixed wavelength. But more advanced","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"obhel891","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"devices—like the one at Matrix Massage in Salem, WI —allow for **multiple, blended","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dzhfh894","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"wavelengths**, including 630, 660, 810, 830, and 850 nm. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c7j4c2000","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"iz1352027","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"This provides a broader therapeutic spectrum, addressing surface and deep-tissue concerns in one session.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4641c2105","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fpexj898","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Want glowing skin? Focus on 630–660 nm.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"96mk9900","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Dealing with muscle pain, inflammation, arthritis, joint pain or nerve recovery? Go with 810–850 nm.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"nwdzt902","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Looking for full-body rejuvenation? Use a device that offers a multi-wavelength output.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dlmcr3209","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"eyxzb3261","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Evidence-Based Outcomes by Wavelength","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":24}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bo1ga3367","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cb33p3421","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **660 nm**: Enhances mitochondrial function and promotes skin healing (Barolet et al.,2009)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wblct3425","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **810 nm**: Boosts brain blood flow and reduces depression symptoms (*Journal of","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ixv7u3427","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Affective Disorders*, 2016)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fbaci3429","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- **850 nm**: Effective for joint pain and reducing inflammation (*Photomedicine and LaserSurgery*, 2014)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"nqt283524","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"j7a6m3586","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Bottom Line","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":24}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bwel8741","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ea37k3775","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The ability to customize your red light therapy experience by wavelength is not just a","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{